# Normalize line endings on commit; check out LF everywhere.
# Without this, a checkout on a Windows-configured client rewrote every tracked
# text file to CRLF and produced a 221-file, 60k-line phantom diff that made the
# working tree unreviewable. See doc/SYNCING-UPSTREAM.md.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary

# Lockfiles are generated; keep them out of diffs and merges.
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff linguist-generated
